WEBVTT

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.450
Where in the...?
Who <i>are</i> you?

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.450
<i>Week's End - Split</i>

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:26.290
The Akagami Cruiser

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.000
As originally planned,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Kunagisa and I were able to leave at the end of the week.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.100
Same - Guest Cabin

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.090
Excuse me.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.600
