00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Um...

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.370
I'd like to thank you for...for everything.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:00.580
Especially you.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.870
I'm grateful to Kunagisa, too, but...

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.670
You really...when you...

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.040
You had a lot of fun, then?

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.210
Akagami Ilia.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:13.300
Yes.

