00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:17.050
<i>Akagami Ilia</i>

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:17.050
<i>Wet Wing Raven
Island's Owner</i>

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:14.800
I did.

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:18.050
I had a great time.

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:19.680
How'd you know?

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:23.520
When did you figure out Rei and I had switched places?

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.640
It just occurred to me.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:30.610
If you had left the room right away, I'd never have noticed.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.440
At least...I'd never have said anything.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:35.900
Interesting.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.820
I always slip up at the end.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.580
My grandfather used to scold me for it.

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:48.290
But what prompted the realization? Tell me that, at least.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:51.170
You didn't say much, Ilia.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.300
It always seemed a little odd.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:57.180
Maybe you were afraid of slipping up if you did...

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.350
But being too quiet gets noticed, too.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:11.560
You had Teruko keep quiet too, to try and make your silence
seem natural, to make your own silence harder to notice, but...

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.860
No...she's always like that.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:21.200
Even if she's not wearing glasses,
I can always tell which one is Teruko.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.660
I mean...she doesn't talk.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.290
Okay...

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.330
Then forget I said that.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:34.500
Anyway, if that Ilia was fake, then there was only
one person she could have traded places with.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:39.260
After all, Akari, Hikari, and Teruko...

